le=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.2<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 16, 2003<br/>Christmas Update 2003</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171005134316&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pile_of_Bones_Quest_829a60.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a pile of bones.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Throughout the world of <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia\">Tibia</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>A human has died here, leaving nothing but a skeleton. Perhaps it holds something valuable.<br/>Looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pile%20of%20Bones\">Pile of Bones</a>.<br/>Such piles are part of the <a href=\"#/quest/battle-axe-quest\">Battle Axe Quest</a>, the <a href=\"#/quest/power-bolts-quest\">Power Bolts Quest</a>, the <a href=\"#/quest/griffin-shield-quest\">Griffin Shield Quest</a>, the <a href=\"#/quest/fire-axe-quest\">Fire Axe Quest</a>, the <a href=\"#/quest/berserk-potion-quest\">Berserk Potion Quest</a>, the <a href=\"#/quest/formorgar-mines-hoist-quest\">Formorgar Mines Hoist Quest</a>, the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>, the <a href=\"#/quest/tinder-box-quest\">Tinder Box Quest</a>, the <a href=\"#/quest/roshamuul-quest\">Roshamuul Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/the-cursed-crystal-quest\">The Cursed Crystal Quest</a>, and the <a href=\"#/quest/twenty-miles-beneath-the-sea-quest\">Twenty Miles Beneath the Sea Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/adventures-of-galthen-quest\">Adventures of Galthen Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arthei%27s%20Descent%20into%20Vampirism%20II%20%28Book%29\">Arthei's Descent into Vampirism II (Book)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/battle-axe-quest\">Battle Axe Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/berserk-potion-quest\">Berserk Potion Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Gardens%20%28Book%29\">Crystal Gardens (Book)</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li>Dworc Misadventure (Book)</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/fire-axe-quest\">Fire Axe Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/formorgar-mines-hoist-quest\">Formorgar Mines Hoist Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fragment%20of%20an%20Ancient%20Disc\">Fragment of an Ancient Disc</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/griffin-shield-quest\">Griffin Shield Quest</a></li><li>Living and Dead</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Part%20of%20an%20Ancient%20Disc\">Part of an Ancient Disc</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pile%20of%20Bones\">Pile of Bones</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/power-bolts-quest\">Power Bolts Quest</a></li><li>Remains</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/roshamuul-quest\">Roshamuul 